    <forecast>
        <area aac="SA_FA001" description="South Australia" type="region">
            <forecast-period start-time-local="2026-09-10T04:10:59+09:30" end-time-local="2026-09-10T04:10:59+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-09-09T18:40:59Z" end-time-utc="2026-09-09T18:40:59Z">
                <text type="warning_summary_footer">For latest warnings go to www.bom.gov.au, subscribe to RSS feeds, call 1300 659 210* or listen for warnings on relevant TV and radio broadcasts.</text>
                <text type="synoptic_situation">A high pressure system centred south of the Bight extends a ridge across the south of SA. The main high centre will gradually move eastwards to be centred to the east of SA on Friday. A trough over the interior of WA will remain stationary for most of the week and may extend into the far west of SA at times. Another low pressure trough will approach from the west on Saturday and move across SA on Sunday.</text>
                <text type="product_footer">* Calls to 1300 numbers cost around 27.5c incl. GST, higher from mobiles or public phones.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
        <area aac="SA_PW014" description="North East Pastoral" type="public-district" parent-aac="SA_FA001">
            <forecast-period index="0" start-time-local="2026-09-10T00:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-09-11T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-09-09T14:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-09-10T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Sunny. Winds southeasterly 35 to 50 km/h. Daytime maximum temperatures between 19 and 27.</text>
                <text type="uv_alert">Sun protection 9:10am to 3:20pm, UV Index predicted to reach 7 [High]</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="1" start-time-local="2026-09-11T00:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-09-12T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-09-10T14:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-09-11T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Sunny. The chance of morning frost south of Yunta. Winds east to southeasterly 25 to 35 km/h tending south to southeasterly 15 to 25 km/h in the late afternoon then tending east to southeasterly in the late evening. Overnight temperatures falling to between 4 and 14 with daytime temperatures reaching 23 to 29.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="2" start-time-local="2026-09-12T00:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-09-13T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-09-11T14:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-09-12T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Sunny. Winds northeast to southeasterly 20 to 30 km/h tending north to northeasterly during the day then tending northeast to southeasterly 15 to 20 km/h during the afternoon. Overnight temperatures falling to between 7 and 16 with daytime temperatures reaching 26 to 32.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="3" start-time-local="2026-09-13T00:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-09-14T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-09-12T14:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-09-13T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">The chance of a thunderstorm in the morning. Sunny day. Winds northeast to southeasterly 15 to 20 km/h tending northwest to northeasterly 15 to 25 km/h during the morning then becoming light during the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to between 12 and 17 with daytime temperatures reaching 28 to 34.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
